sword with exactly enchantment 5 → high-enchantment surcharge applies\n15. should apply first insurance surcharge to a long-standing customer's new sword -- example: long-standing customer with brand-new sword: first insurance surcharge still applies\n16. should apply 100 G deductible per damage event for each damaged item -- example: dragon attack damages sword (500 G) and amulet (300 G) → payout = 600 G (100 G deductible per item)\n17. should reimburse 400 G for a regular sword (steel, enchantment 3), damage 500 G -- example: payout 400 G\n18. should reimburse 100 G for a rune, damage 200 G -- example: payout 100 G (full reimbursement minus 100 G deductible)\n19. should reimburse 400 G for a dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G -- example: both clauses apply; 50 % rule wins → payout 400 G\n20. should reimburse 700 G for a dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, damage 800 G -- example: only dragon-material clause applies → payout 700 G\n21. should reimburse 400 G for a steel sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G -- example: only high-enchantment clause applies → payout 400 G\n22. should reject claim if damages exceed number of items insured -- clarification: two swords damaged when only one insured → reject claim\n23. should set insurance sum to 2000 G and cap to 4000 G"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950311495,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a843189b-ca58-45a8-8a28-7cab7ff3fe27","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}},"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: MHPCO Claim Office\n**Test File**: claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 30\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should have a base premium of 100 G for a sword 