p 4000 G\n24. should have a cap of 2000 G for a cursed sword (insurance value 1000 G) -- example: cap based on unmodified insurance value\n25. should have an insurance sum of 1750 G for a sword and 3 runes -- example: block discount affects premium only, not insurance sum\n26. should have first claim payout 1400 G with 600 G remaining cap -- example: sword policy (cap 2000 G), first claim 1500 G → payout 1400 G, cap remaining 600 G\n27. should have second claim payout 600 G with 0 G remaining cap -- example: second claim 1500 G → payout 600 G, cap remaining 0 G\n28. should calculate premium as 198 G when raw calculation is 197.5 G -- example: rounded up in MHPCO's favor\n29. should calculate payout as 350 G when raw calculation is 350.5 G -- example: rounded down in MHPCO's favor\n30. should charge 5 G premium for an empty item list -- example: premium 5 G (only processing fee)\n31. should exit with"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950311495,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a843189b-ca58-45a8-8a28-7cab7ff3fe27","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
