 calculation is 197.5 G -- example: rounded up in MHPCO's favor\n29. should calculate payout as 350 G when raw calculation is 350.5 G -- example: rounded down in MHPCO's favor\n30. should charge 5 G premium for an empty item list -- example: premium 5 G (only processing fee)\n31. should exit with non-zero status for an unknown item type in quote -- example: type 'broomstick' → CLI exits with error\n32. should exit with non-zero status for a damage entry with item not in policy -- example: amulet damaged when only sword insured → CLI exits with error\n33. should exit with non-zero status for a damage amount of -200 G -- example: invalid amount → CLI exits with error\n34. should calculate 165 G premium for a newcomer with a cursed sword -- example: base 100 + curse 50 + first insurance 10 + fee 5 ="}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950311495,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-a843189b-ca58-45a8-8a28-7cab7ff3fe27","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}},"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: MHPCO Claim Office\n**Test File**: claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 30\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should have a base premium of 100 G for a sword -- example: Sword: 1000 G insurance value, 100 G base premium\n2. should have a base premium of 60 G for an amulet -- example: Amulet: 600 G / 60 G\n3. should have a base premium of 80 G for a staff -- example: Staff: 800 G / 80 G\n4. should have a base premium of 40 G for a potion -- example: Potion: 400 G / 40 G\n5. should have a base premium of 25 G per component (rune or moonstone) -- example: Components insured at 250 G each, 25 G base premium\n6. should apply a special base premium of 